			"Message": "docs(Element): standardize README badges and benefit-focused copy across all submodules\n\nUpdate documentation across 13 Element submodules to improve visual branding and developer messaging:\n\n- Add SimpleIcons vendor badges (Rust, TypeScript, WASM, Astro, Effect-TS, Tauri) to README headers in Air, Common, Echo, Grove, Sky, Vine, Wind, Worker\n- Rewrite READMEs with benefit-focused copy in Cocoon, Mist, Rest, SideCar — replacing verbose technical documentation with outcome-oriented messaging\n\nThis ensures consistent visual presentation and developer-facing value propositions across the entire Land editor component library, aligning with the website's goal-oriented messaging direction.",
